WEBVTT

live-01
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.073
Participants take turns drafting athletes.

live-02
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.016
Taylor selects the first athlete.

live-03
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.285
Jordan selects the next athlete.

live-04
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:18.067
Casey follows. Each pick updates the log and roster. Drafted athletes cannot be picked again.

live-05
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:27.238
Round two reverses the order for the snake draft. Sam picks first this round, and the other approved participants take their turns.

live-06
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.991
Taylor closes round two with pick twelve.

live-07
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.715
Taylor has two FPO athletes. Only MPO is offered.

live-08
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:44.751
Jordan already has two MPO athletes, so only FPO athletes are offered.

live-09
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.575
The remaining participants continue building their four-athlete rosters.

live-10
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.946
Two MPO, one FPO. Only FPO can complete this roster.

live-11
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.239
One MPO, two FPO. Only MPO can complete this roster.

live-12
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.744
Only athletes from the needed division remain selectable.

live-13
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.402
Taylor makes the final pick.

live-14
00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:16.076
Final rosters: two MPO and two FPO athletes.
